<Layout
  title="Agence KOL Chine : marketing d'influence et ventes"
  description="TheChinaPath pilote des campagnes KOL et KOC en Chine jugées sur la vente, pas sur le nombre de vues. Sélection des créateurs guidée par la donnée sur Douyin, Xiaohongshu, Tmall et JD."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqJsonLd)} is:inline />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(serviceJsonLd)} is:inline />

  <div class="kol-progress" aria-hidden="true"><div class="kol-progress__bar"></div></div>
  <article class="kol">

    {/* ---------- HERO ---------- */}
    <section class="kol-hero" data-hero>
      <div class="kol-hero__bg" aria-hidden="true" data-parallax>
        <img src="/Images/grow-in-china/influencers-kols/hero-kol-livestream.png" alt="Une jeune animatrice livestream chinoise installée sur un petit plateau à domicile, ring light allumée, présente un flacon de cosmétique en plein argumentaire" />
      </div>
      <div class="kol-hero__overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="kol-hero__grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="container kol-hero__inner">
        <nav class="kol-hero__crumbs" aria-label="Fil d'Ariane">
          <a href="/fr/">Accueil</a>
          <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <a href="/fr/#services">Se développer en Chine</a>
        </nav>
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-dark kol-reveal">Influence et KOL</span>
        <h1 class="kol-hero__title kol-reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 80ms;">
          <span class="kol-hero__title-row">À l'Ouest, un influenceur capte l'attention.</span>
          <span class="kol-hero__title-row kol-hero__title-row--accent">En Chine, il referme la vente.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="kol-hero__lead kol-reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 200ms;">
          Sur Instagram, le créateur joue le haut du tunnel. En Chine, la découverte, la recherche
          et le paiement tiennent sur un seul écran, dans la même minute. Le KOL n'incarne pas la couche
          notoriété : il tient la caisse. On choisit donc les créateurs sur la donnée, on cale
          des briefs serrés, et notre rémunération reste indexée sur les ventes réellement enregistrées.
        </p>
        <div class="kol-hero__actions kol-reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 280ms;">
          <a href="/fr/nous-contacter" class="btn btn--primary kol-magnetic">Échanger sur votre campagne</a>
          <a href="/fr/decryptages" class="btn btn--ghost-light kol-magnetic">Lire nos décryptages Chine</a>
        </div>

        <div class="kol-hero__meta kol-reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 360ms;">
          {heroStats.map((s) => (
            <div class="kol-hero__meta-item">
              <span class="kol-hero__meta-num">{s.num}{s.suffix}</span>
              <span class="kol-hero__meta-label">{s.label}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <a href="#why" class="kol-hero__scroll" aria-label="Aller à la section suivante">
        <span class="kol-hero__scroll-line"></span>
        <span class="kol-hero__scroll-text">Faire défiler</span>
      </a>
    </section>

    {/* ---------- WHY CHINA IS A DIFFERENT GAME ---------- */}
    <section id="why" class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="section-header section-header--center kol-reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Un autre terrain</span>
          <h2>Pourquoi la Chine impose ses propres règles</h2>
          <p class="section-header__lead">
            La plupart des marques arrivent armées du playbook occidental, et perdent un trimestre
            d'investissement avant d'en comprendre la cause. Trois erreurs reviennent presque à chaque fois.
          </p>
        </header>

        <ul class="kol-points kol-reveal">
          {whyPoints.map((p, i) => (
            <li class="kol-point" style={`--reveal-delay: ${i * 80}ms;`}>
              <span class="kol-point__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <div>
                <h3>{p.lead}</h3>
                <p>{p.body}</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <div class="kol-quotes">
          {whyQuotes.map((q, i) => (
            <figure class={`kol-quote-card kol-reveal`} style={`--reveal-delay: ${i * 120}ms;`}>
              <div class="kol-quote-card__media">
                <img src={q.image} alt={q.alt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              </div>
              <blockquote class="kol-quote-card__body">
                <p>{q.quote}</p>
                <footer>
                  <cite>{q.cite}</cite>
                  <span class="kol-quote-card__meta">{q.citeMeta}</span>
                </footer>
              </blockquote>
            </figure>
          ))}
        </div>

        <p class="kol-aftertext kol-reveal">
          Un dernier déplacement de fond mérite d'être noté. L'ère de la location d'une seule grande signature
          touche à sa fin. Les livestreams animés directement depuis la boutique de la marque concentrent
          désormais la plus large part du commerce sur Douyin, et les KOL de premier rang prélèvent
          leur commission de 40 à 50 %. Lorsqu'un acheteur se renseigne sur votre produit, dix mentions
          authentiques pèseront plus lourd qu'une publication sponsorisée signée d'une vedette.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ---------- SO HERE IS HOW WE RUN IT ---------- */}
    <section id="how" class="section section--alt">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="section-header section-header--center kol-reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Ce que nous faisons</span>
          <h2>Notre façon de l'opérer</h2>
          <p class="section-header__lead">
            Un seul opérateur, du casting au reporting, en passant par le brief et la production. Le plan présenté
            en réunion est celui qui tourne sur la plateforme dès le lundi suivant.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="kol-grid kol-grid--4">
          {howSteps.map((s, i) => (
            <article class="kol-card kol-reveal" style={`--reveal-delay: ${i * 60}ms;`}>
              <span class="kol-card__icon" aria-hidden="true" set:html={icons[s.icon]} />
              <h3 class="kol-card__title">{s.title}</h3>
              <p class="kol-card__body">{s.body}</p>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>

        <blockquote class="kol-pull kol-reveal">
          <p>Un million d'abonnés ne pèsent rien si la moitié n'achètera jamais dans votre catégorie. Nous lisons la composition de l'audience avant d'en regarder le volume. Sans exception.</p>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ---------- WHAT IS AN MCN ---------- */}
    <section id="mcn" class="section">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <header class="section-header kol-reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">MCN</span>
          <h2>Qu'est-ce qu'une MCN, et pourquoi cela pèse</h2>
        </header>

        <div class="kol-prose kol-reveal">
          <p>
            Une MCN, multi-channel network, est une agence qui signe des créateurs et pilote l'ensemble
            de leur activité : production de contenu, contrats, partenariats de marque, exploitation
            des livestreams.
          </p>
          <p>
            En Chine, les MCN structurent l'économie entière des créateurs. La quasi-totalité des KOL et
            des KOC actifs y sont sous contrat. Lorsque vous réservez un créateur, vous négociez en réalité
            avec sa MCN, jamais en direct avec la personne, et cette MCN défend les intérêts du créateur,
            jamais ceux de votre marque.
          </p>
          <p>
            Nous travaillons quotidiennement avec ces structures, et nous les contournons dès que votre
            intérêt commande de le faire. La règle ne varie pas : il vous faut quelqu'un de votre côté
            de la table.
          </p>
        </div>

        <figure class="kol-figure kol-reveal">
          <img
            src="/Images/grow-in-china/influencers-kols/mcn-creator-signing.png"
            alt="Un créateur chinois et un responsable MCN examinent un contrat sur un ordinateur portable dans un bureau sobre, lampe néon au plafond"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ---------- WHAT YOU ACTUALLY GET ---------- */}
    <section id="get" class="section section--alt">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="section-header section-header--center kol-reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Ce que vous obtenez</span>
          <h2>Ce que vous obtenez vraiment</h2>
          <p class="section-header__lead">
            Un accès direct aux créateurs, une sélection guidée par la donnée, et un reporting qui raccorde
            chaque yuan investi à une vente identifiable.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="kol-grid kol-grid--4">
          {benefits.map((b, i) => (
            <article class="kol-card kol-card--benefit kol-reveal" style={`--reveal-delay: ${i * 60}ms;`}>
              <span class="kol-card__icon" aria-hidden="true" set:html={icons[b.icon]} />
              <h3 class="kol-card__lead">{b.lead}</h3>
              <p class="kol-card__body">{b.body}</p>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ---------- PLATFORMS WE RUN ---------- */}
    <section id="platforms" class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="section-header section-header--center kol-reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Plateformes</span>
          <h2>Plateformes que nous pilotons</h2>
          <p class="section-header__lead">
            Sept plateformes couvertes de bout en bout. Nous retenons les deux ou trois qui correspondent
            à votre catégorie, jamais l'ensemble en même temps.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="kol-platforms">
          {platforms.map((p, i) => (
            <article class="kol-platform kol-reveal" style={`--reveal-delay: ${i * 50}ms;`}>
              <header class="kol-platform__head">
                <h3 class="kol-platform__name">{p.name}</h3>
                {p.cn && <span class="kol-platform__cn" lang="zh">{p.cn}</span>}
              </header>
              <p class="kol-platform__desc">{p.desc}</p>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ---------- ANNUAIRE KOL ---------- */}
    <section id="directory" class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="section-header section-header--center kol-reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">L'annuaire</span>
          <h2>Quatre-vingts KOL chinois qui comptent</h2>
          <p class="section-header__lead">
            Un échantillon. Huit verticales, des sources chinoises uniquement. Pour chaque
            créateur : sa niche, l'ordre de grandeur de son audience, et les marques avec
            lesquelles il a déjà travaillé. Ni cartographie exhaustive du KOL chinois, ni
            notre vivier. Un point de départ.
          </p>
        </header>

        <nav class="kol-dir-chips kol-reveal" aria-label="Aller à une verticale">
          {kolsRoot.industries.map((ind) => {
            const fr = industryFr(ind.id);
            return (
              <a
                href={`#dir-${ind.id}`}
                class="kol-dir-chip"
                style={`--ind-color: ${ind.color};`}
              >
                <span class="kol-dir-chip__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="kol-dir-chip__en">{fr.name}</span>
                <span class="kol-dir-chip__zh" lang="zh">{ind.name_zh}</span>
              </a>
            );
          })}
        </nav>

        {kolsRoot.industries.map((ind) => {
          const fr = industryFr(ind.id);
          return (
            <section
              id={`dir-${ind.id}`}
              class="kol-dir-vertical kol-reveal"
              aria-labelledby={`dir-${ind.id}-heading`}
            >
              <header class="kol-dir-vertical__head">
                <span
                  class="kol-dir-vertical__bar"
                  style={`background:${ind.color};`}
                  aria-hidden="true"
                ></span>
                <div class="kol-dir-vertical__title">
                  <p class="kol-dir-vertical__eyebrow" style={`color:${ind.color};`} lang="zh">
                    {ind.name_zh}
                  </p>
                  <h3 id={`dir-${ind.id}-heading`} class="kol-dir-vertical__h">
                    {fr.name}
                  </h3>
                  <p class="kol-dir-vertical__tag">{fr.tagline}</p>
                </div>
                <p class="kol-dir-vertical__count">
                  <span>{ind.kols.length}</span>
                  <span class="kol-dir-vertical__count-label">KOL</span>
                </p>
              </header>

              {ind.id === 'healthcare' && (
                <p class="kol-dir-note" role="note">
                  <strong>Partenariats marques.</strong> {kolsFrData.meta.healthcare_note}
                </p>
              )}

              <div class="kol-dir-grid">
                {ind.kols.map((k) => {
                  const extra = Math.max(0, k.platforms.length - 1);
                  const visibleBrands = k.notable_brands.slice(0, 3);
                  const overflow = k.notable_brands.length - visibleBrands.length;
                  const tm = tierMetaFr[k.tier];
                  return (
                    <article id={k.id} class="kol-dir-card" style={`--ind-color: ${ind.color};`}>
                      <span class="kol-dir-card__accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                      <header class="kol-dir-card__head">
                        <div
                          class="kol-dir-card__avatar"
                          style={`background:${ind.color};`}
                          aria-hidden="true"
                        >
                          {k.avatar_initials}
                        </div>
                        <div class="kol-dir-card__id">
                          <h4 class="kol-dir-card__zh" lang="zh">{k.name_zh}</h4>
                          <p class="kol-dir-card__en">{k.name_en}</p>
                        </div>
                      </header>

                      <div class="kol-dir-card__tags">
                        <span class={`kol-dir-tier kol-dir-tier--${k.tier}`} title={localiseTierLabel(k.tier_label)}>
                          {tm.short}
                          <span class="sr-only">. {tm.sr}</span>
                        </span>
                        <span class="kol-dir-card__platform">
                          {k.primary_platform_label}
                          {extra > 0 && (
                            <span
                              class="kol-dir-card__platform-extra"
                              title={`Aussi actif sur ${extra} autre${extra === 1 ? '' : 's'} plateforme${extra === 1 ? '' : 's'} : ${k.platforms.slice(1).join(', ')}`}
                            >
                              +{extra}
                            </span>
                          )}
                        </span>
                      </div>

                      <p class="kol-dir-card__followers">
                        <span class="kol-dir-card__followers-label">Audience.</span>
                        {' '}{k.followers_text}
                      </p>

                      <p class="kol-dir-card__specialty">{specialtyFr(k.id, k.specialty)}</p>

                      {visibleBrands.length > 0 && (
                        <div class="kol-dir-card__brands">
                          <p class="kol-dir-card__brands-label">Collaborations notables</p>
                          <ul class="kol-dir-brand-pills">
                            {visibleBrands.map((b) => (
                              <li class="kol-dir-brand-pill">{b}</li>
                            ))}
                            {overflow > 0 && (
                              <li class="kol-dir-brand-pill kol-dir-brand-pill--more">
                                +{overflow} autres
                              </li>
                            )}
                          </ul>
                        </div>
                      )}

                      <footer class="kol-dir-card__foot">
                        <p class="kol-dir-card__source">{k.source_note}</p>
                        <a
                          class="kol-dir-card__link"
                          href={k.profile_url}
                          target="_blank"
                          rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        >
                          Voir le profil <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                          <span class="sr-only">s'ouvre dans un nouvel onglet</span>
                        </a>
                      </footer>
                    </article>
                  );
                })}
              </div>

              <script
                type="application/ld+json"
                set:html={JSON.stringify(directoryItemListJsonLdFr(ind))}
                is:inline
              />
            </section>
          );
        })}

        <details class="kol-dir-method kol-reveal">
          <summary class="kol-dir-method__summary">Méthodologie et sources</summary>
          <div class="kol-dir-method__body">
            <p>
              <strong>Définition des paliers.</strong> Top : {kolsFrData.meta.tier_definitions.top}.
              Intermédiaire : {kolsFrData.meta.tier_definitions.mid}. En ascension :{' '}
              {kolsFrData.meta.tier_definitions.rising}.
            </p>
            <p>{kolsFrData.meta.follower_data_note}</p>
            <p>
              <strong>Sources.</strong> {kolsRoot.meta.sources.join(' · ')}.
            </p>
            <p class="kol-dir-method__foot">
              Recherche menée en chinois à partir de sources chinoises. Préparé pour{' '}
              {kolsRoot.meta.prepared_for}.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ---------- FAQ ---------- */}
    <section id="faq" class="section section--alt">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <header class="section-header section-header--center kol-reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
          <h2>Les questions que les marques nous posent vraiment</h2>
          <p class="section-header__lead">
            Vingt questions revenues sur la table dès le premier rendez-vous. À filtrer par thème.
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="kol-faq-filter kol-reveal" data-faq-filter role="tablist" aria-label="Filtrer la FAQ par catégorie">
          {faqCategories.map((c, i) => (
            <button
              type="button"
              class={`kol-faq-chip${i === 0 ? ' is-active' : ''}`}
              role="tab"
              aria-selected={i === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}
              data-faq-cat={c}
            >
              <span class="kol-faq-chip__label">{c}</span>
              <span class="kol-faq-chip__count">{c === "Toutes" ? faqs.length : faqs.filter((f) => f.cat === c).length}</span>
            </button>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="kol-faq" data-faq-list>
          {faqs.map((f, i) => (
            <details
              class="kol-faq__item kol-reveal"
              data-faq-cat={f.cat}
              open={i === 0}
              style={`--reveal-delay: ${Math.min(i, 6) * 40}ms;`}
            >
              <summary class="kol-faq__q">
                <span class="kol-faq__cat-tag">{f.cat}</span>
                <span class="kol-faq__q-text">{f.q}</span>
                <span class="kol-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
                </span>
              </summary>
              <div class="kol-faq__a">
                <p>{f.a}</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ---------- FINAL CTA ---------- */}
    <section class="section section--tight">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="kol-cta">
          <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-dark">Échangeons</span>
          <h2 class="kol-cta__title">Un dernier point avant de refermer la page</h2>
          <p class="kol-cta__lead">
            Les marques qui s'imposent en Chine ne sont pas celles qui alignent le plus gros budget
            d'influence. Ce sont celles qui s'y sont engagées tant que le canal demeurait sous-évalué.
            La fenêtre reste ouverte aujourd'hui. Elle ne le restera pas. Nous conseillons, puis nous
            exécutons ce que nous recommandons. Pour un programme KOL et KOC bâti sur la donnée, jugé
            sur les ventes effectivement enregistrées, ouvrons la conversation.
          </p>
          <div class="kol-cta__actions">
            <a href="/fr/nous-contacter" class="btn kol-cta__btn-primary">Engager la conversation</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>

  <style is:global>
    .kol .container--narrow { max-width: 880px; }

    /* ---------- REVEAL + MOTION ---------- */
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
      .kol-reveal {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(16px);
        transition:
          opacity 700ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) var(--reveal-delay, 0ms),
          transform 700ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) var(--reveal-delay, 0ms);
      }
      .kol-reveal.is-in { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
      .kol-magnetic {
        will-change: transform;
        transition: transform 220ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1),
                    box-shadow 220ms ease, background-color 200ms ease, color 200ms ease;
      }
      .kol-magnetic:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    }

    /* ---------- SCROLL PROGRESS BAR ---------- */
    .kol-progress {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 3px; z-index: 1000;
      background: transparent; pointer-events: none;
    }
    .kol-progress__bar {
      height: 100%; width: var(--progress, 0%);
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--bbg-blue) 0%, #E84A60 60%, #C8102E 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(200, 16, 46, 0.55);
      transition: width 80ms linear;
    }

    /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
    .kol-hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: clamp(360px, 48vh, 500px);
      display: flex; align-items: flex-start;
      padding: clamp(8px, 1.25vh, 16px) 0 clamp(48px, 7vh, 80px);
      color: var(--bbg-white);
      overflow: hidden; isolation: isolate;
    }
    body:has(.kol-hero) .kol-hero { padding-top: clamp(112px, 10vh, 144px); }
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      body:has(.kol-hero) .kol-hero { padding-top: clamp(96px, 9vh, 116px); }
    }
    .kol-hero__bg { position: absolute; inset: -10% 0 0; z-index: -3; }
    .kol-hero__bg img {
      width: 100%; height: 110%;
      object-fit: cover; object-position: center;
      transform: translate3d(0, var(--parallax-y, 0px), 0) scale(1.04);
      transition: transform 80ms linear;
      filter: saturate(0.95);
    }
    .kol-hero__overlay {
      position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -2;
      background:
        linear-gradient(110deg,
          rgba(8, 18, 28, 0.92) 0%,
          rgba(8, 18, 28, 0.72) 42%,
          rgba(8, 18, 28, 0.32) 100%),
        radial-gradient(120% 80% at 0% 100%,
          rgba(200, 16, 46, 0.28) 0%,
          rgba(200, 16, 46, 0) 60%);
    }
    .kol-hero__grain {
      position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -1;
      background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 3px 3px;
      mix-blend-mode: overlay; opacity: 0.45;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .kol-hero__inner { max-width: 980px; position: relative; }
    .kol-hero__crumbs {
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
      font-size: var(--fs-small);
      display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    }
    .kol-hero__crumbs a { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); font-weight: 500; }
    .kol-hero__crumbs a:hover { color: var(--bbg-white); }
    .kol-hero__inner .eyebrow--on-dark {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
      color: #C8102E;
    }
    .kol-hero__title {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.4vw + 1rem, 3.75rem);
      line-height: 1.06;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      color: var(--bbg-white);
      margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
      max-width: 24ch;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.05em;
    }
    .kol-hero__title-row { display: block; }
    .kol-hero__title-row--accent {
      color: #C8102E; font-weight: 500;
      font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    }
    .kol-hero__lead {
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 0.5vw + 1rem, 1.1875rem);
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
      max-width: 62ch;
      margin: 0 0 var(--space-5);
    }
    .kol-hero__actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-3); margin-bottom: var(--space-6); }

    .kol-hero__meta {
      display: flex; flex-wrap: nowrap;
      gap: clamp(var(--space-3), 3vw, var(--space-6));
      padding-top: var(--space-5);
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
      max-width: none;
    }
    .kol-hero__meta-item {
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.2rem;
      min-width: 0;
      flex: 1 1 0;
    }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .kol-hero__meta { flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .kol-hero__meta-item { flex: 1 1 auto; }
    }
    .kol-hero__meta-num {
      font-size: clamp(1.625rem, 1.2vw + 1rem, 2.125rem);
      font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1; color: var(--bbg-white);
      font-feature-settings: "tnum";
    }
    .kol-hero__meta-label {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.66);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .kol-hero__scroll {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: var(--space-5);
      right: clamp(var(--space-5), 4vw, var(--space-7));
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600;
      transition: color 200ms ease;
    }
    .kol-hero__scroll:hover { color: var(--bbg-white); }
    .kol-hero__scroll-line {
      width: 1px; height: 40px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6) 100%);
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .kol-hero__scroll-line::after {
      content: ""; position: absolute;
      top: -100%; left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, var(--bbg-white) 100%);
      animation: kol-scroll-tick 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes kol-scroll-tick { 0% { top: -50%; } 100% { top: 100%; } }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .kol-hero__scroll { display: none; }
      .kol-hero__meta { gap: var(--space-4); }
    }

    /* ---------- WHY POINTS ---------- */
    .kol-points {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: var(--space-6) auto 0;
      max-width: 880px;
      display: grid;
      gap: var(--space-5);
    }
    .kol-point {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-5);
      align-items: start;
      padding: var(--space-5) 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
    }
    .kol-point:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bbg-border); }
    .kol-point__mark {
      display: block;
      width: 6px;
      height: 28px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bbg-blue) 0%, #E84A60 100%);
      margin-top: 0.6rem;
    }
    .kol-point h3 {
      font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 0.6vw + 1rem, 1.375rem);
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
      letter-spacing: -0.005em;
      color: var(--bbg-ink);
    }
    .kol-point p {
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: var(--bbg-text);
      margin: 0;
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .kol-point { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--space-2); }
      .kol-point__mark { width: 36px; height: 4px; margin-top: 0; }
    }

    /* ---------- QUOTE CARDS (stats) ---------- */
    .kol-quotes {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-5);
      margin-top: var(--space-7);
    }
    .kol-quote-card {
      background: var(--bbg-white);
      border: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      overflow: hidden;
      margin: 0;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      transition: border-color var(--dur) var(--ease), box-shadow var(--dur) var(--ease);
    }
    .kol-quote-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--bbg-blue);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 32px -22px rgba(200, 16, 46, 0.4);
    }
    .kol-quote-card__media {
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--bbg-border);
    }
    .kol-quote-card__media img {
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover; display: block;
      transition: transform 600ms var(--ease);
    }
    .kol-quote-card:hover .kol-quote-card__media img { transform: scale(1.03); }
    .kol-quote-card__body {
      padding: var(--space-6);
      margin: 0;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--bbg-blue);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(232, 244, 252, 0.4) 0%, rgba(232, 244, 252, 0) 100%);
    }
    .kol-quote-card__body p {
      margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--bbg-ink);
      font-weight: 500;
      font-style: italic;
    }
    .kol-quote-card__body footer {
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.2rem;
      padding-top: var(--space-3);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
    }
    .kol-quote-card__body cite {
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--bbg-ink);
    }
    .kol-quote-card__meta {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--bbg-text-muted);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .kol-quotes { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    .kol-aftertext {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: var(--space-7) auto 0;
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--bbg-text);
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* ---------- 4-CARD GRID ---------- */
    .kol-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: var(--space-5);
    }
    .kol-grid--4 {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .kol-grid--4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .kol-grid--4 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    .kol-card {
      position: relative;
      background: var(--bbg-white);
      border: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: var(--space-6);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-3);
      transition:
        transform 320ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
        border-color 260ms ease,
        box-shadow 260ms ease;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .kol-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--bbg-blue) 0%, #E84A60 100%);
      transform: scaleX(0);
      transform-origin: left center;
      transition: transform 360ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
    .kol-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: var(--bbg-blue);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 32px -20px rgba(200, 16, 46, 0.4);
    }
    .kol-card:hover::before { transform: scaleX(1); }
    .kol-card__icon {
      display: inline-flex;
      width: 44px; height: 44px;
      align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bbg-blue-light) 0%, rgba(200, 16, 46, 0.18) 100%);
      color: var(--bbg-blue);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    }
    .kol-card__icon svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }
    .kol-card__title {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      line-height: 1.25;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--bbg-ink);
      letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    }
    .kol-card__lead {
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--bbg-ink);
      letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    }
    .kol-card__body {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--bbg-text);
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* ---------- PULL QUOTE ---------- */
    .kol-pull {
      margin: var(--space-7) auto 0;
      max-width: 820px;
      padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-7);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bbg-blue-light) 0%, rgba(200, 16, 46, 0.10) 100%);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--bbg-blue);
      border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;
    }
    .kol-pull p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 0.4vw + 1rem, 1.25rem);
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--bbg-ink);
      font-weight: 500;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    /* ---------- PROSE ---------- */
    .kol-prose {
      margin-top: var(--space-5);
    }
    .kol-prose p {
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      line-height: 1.75;
      color: var(--bbg-text);
      margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
    }
    .kol-prose p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .kol-figure {
      margin: var(--space-7) 0 0;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
      background: var(--bbg-border);
    }
    .kol-figure img {
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover; display: block;
    }

    /* ---------- PLATFORMS ---------- */
    .kol-platforms {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-4);
    }
    .kol-platforms > :nth-child(5),
    .kol-platforms > :nth-child(6),
    .kol-platforms > :nth-child(7) {
      grid-column: span 1;
    }
    .kol-platforms > :last-child {
      grid-column: span 2;
    }
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .kol-platforms { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .kol-platforms > :last-child { grid-column: span 2; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .kol-platforms { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .kol-platforms > :last-child { grid-column: span 1; }
    }
    .kol-platform {
      background: var(--bbg-white);
      border: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: var(--space-5);
      transition: border-color 240ms ease, box-shadow 240ms ease, transform 280ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
    .kol-platform:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: var(--bbg-blue);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 28px -22px rgba(200, 16, 46, 0.4);
    }
    .kol-platform__head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: var(--space-3);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .kol-platform__name {
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      margin: 0;
      letter-spacing: -0.005em;
      color: var(--bbg-ink);
    }
    .kol-platform__cn {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--bbg-blue);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .kol-platform__desc {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--bbg-text);
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* ---------- KOL DIRECTORY ---------- */
    .kol-dir-chips {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: var(--space-5) auto var(--space-7);
      max-width: 1000px;
    }
    .kol-dir-chip {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.5rem 0.95rem;
      background: var(--bbg-white);
      border: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--bbg-ink);
      transition: border-color var(--dur) var(--ease), color var(--dur) var(--ease),
                  transform 220ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
                  box-shadow var(--dur) var(--ease);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .kol-dir-chip:hover {
      border-color: var(--ind-color);
      color: var(--ind-color);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px -18px var(--ind-color);
    }
    .kol-dir-chip__dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--ind-color);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .kol-dir-chip__zh {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--bbg-text-muted);
    }

    .kol-dir-vertical {
      scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--nav-h) + 1rem);
      padding-top: var(--space-7);
      padding-bottom: var(--space-6);
    }
    .kol-dir-vertical:first-of-type {
      padding-top: var(--space-5);
    }
    .kol-dir-vertical__head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: var(--space-5);
      padding-bottom: var(--space-5);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
      position: relative;
    }
    .kol-dir-vertical__bar {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      bottom: -2px;
      width: 64px;
      height: 3px;
      border-radius: 2px;
    }
    .kol-dir-vertical__title { min-width: 0; flex: 1 1 auto; }
    .kol-dir-vertical__eyebrow {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
    }
    .kol-dir-vertical__h {
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1.2vw + 1rem, 2rem);
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
      color: var(--bbg-ink);
      letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    }
    .kol-dir-vertical__tag {
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 60ch;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--bbg-text);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .kol-dir-vertical__count {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 0.35rem;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--bbg-text-muted);
    }
    .kol-dir-vertical__count > span:first-child {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--bbg-ink);
      font-feature-settings: "tnum";
    }
    .kol-dir-vertical__count-label { font-weight: 500; }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .kol-dir-vertical__head {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: var(--space-3);
      }
    }

    .kol-dir-note {
      margin: 0 0 var(--space-5);
      padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
      background: var(--bbg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--bbg-warning);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--bbg-text);
    }
    .kol-dir-note strong { color: var(--bbg-ink); font-weight: 700; }

    .kol-dir-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: var(--space-4);
    }
    @media (max-width: 1280px) {
      .kol-dir-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .kol-dir-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .kol-dir-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    .kol-dir-card {
      position: relative;
      background: var(--bbg-white);
      border: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: var(--space-5);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-3);
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform 320ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
                  border-color var(--dur) var(--ease),
                  box-shadow var(--dur) var(--ease);
    }
    .kol-dir-card:hover,
    .kol-dir-card:focus-within {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: var(--ind-color);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 32px -22px var(--ind-color);
    }
    .kol-dir-card__accent {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 22px;
      width: 3px;
      height: 28px;
      border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0;
      background: var(--ind-color);
    }
    .kol-dir-card__head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: var(--space-3);
      min-width: 0;
    }
    .kol-dir-card__avatar {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--bbg-white);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    }
    .kol-dir-card__id { min-width: 0; flex: 1 1 auto; }
    .kol-dir-card__zh {
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      line-height: 1.25;
      margin: 0 0 0.15rem;
      color: var(--bbg-ink);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.005em;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }
    .kol-dir-card__en {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--bbg-text-muted);
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .kol-dir-card__tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin-top: -0.25rem;
    }
    .kol-dir-tier {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0.18rem 0.55rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      color: var(--bbg-white);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .kol-dir-tier--top    { background: #2E7D32; }
    .kol-dir-tier--mid    { background: #C77800; }
    .kol-dir-tier--rising { background: #455A64; }

    .kol-dir-card__platform {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.35rem;
      padding: 0.18rem 0.55rem;
      background: var(--bbg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--bbg-text);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .kol-dir-card__platform-extra {
      padding: 0.02rem 0.35rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--bbg-white);
      border: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
      color: var(--bbg-text-muted);
      font-size: 0.66rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: help;
    }

    .kol-dir-card__followers {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--bbg-text);
    }
    .kol-dir-card__followers-label {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--bbg-ink);
    }
    .kol-dir-card__specialty {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--bbg-text);
    }

    .kol-dir-card__brands { margin-top: var(--space-2); }
    .kol-dir-card__brands-label {
      margin: 0 0 0.45rem;
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--bbg-text-muted);
    }
    .kol-dir-brand-pills {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.35rem;
    }
    .kol-dir-brand-pill {
      padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--bbg-text);
      background: var(--bbg-white);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .kol-dir-brand-pill--more {
      border-style: dashed;
      color: var(--bbg-text-muted);
    }

    .kol-dir-card__foot {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: var(--space-3);
      margin-top: auto;
      padding-top: var(--space-3);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
    }
    .kol-dir-card__source {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
      color: var(--bbg-text-muted);
      flex: 1 1 auto;
      min-width: 0;
    }
    .kol-dir-card__link {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--bbg-ink);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
      padding-bottom: 1px;
      transition: color var(--dur) var(--ease), border-color var(--dur) var(--ease);
    }
    .kol-dir-card__link:hover,
    .kol-dir-card__link:focus-visible {
      color: var(--ind-color);
      border-bottom-color: var(--ind-color);
    }

    .kol-dir-method {
      margin: var(--space-7) auto 0;
      max-width: 880px;
      background: var(--bbg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: var(--space-5);
      transition: border-color var(--dur) var(--ease);
    }
    .kol-dir-method[open] { border-color: var(--bbg-blue); }
    .kol-dir-method__summary {
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--bbg-ink);
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    .kol-dir-method__summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    .kol-dir-method__summary::after {
      content: "+";
      margin-left: auto;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--bbg-text-muted);
      transition: transform 220ms ease;
    }
    .kol-dir-method[open] .kol-dir-method__summary::after { content: "−"; }
    .kol-dir-method__body {
      margin-top: var(--space-4);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: var(--bbg-text);
    }
    .kol-dir-method__body p { margin: 0 0 var(--space-3); }
    .kol-dir-method__body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .kol-dir-method__body strong { color: var(--bbg-ink); }
    .kol-dir-method__foot {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--bbg-text-muted);
    }

    .kol-dir-card .sr-only,
    .kol-dir-tier .sr-only {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px; height: 1px;
      padding: 0; margin: -1px;
      overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
      white-space: nowrap; border: 0;
    }

    /* ---------- FAQ ---------- */
    .kol-faq {
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-3);
    }
    .kol-faq__item {
      background: var(--bbg-white);
      border: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: border-color 240ms ease, box-shadow 240ms ease, transform 280ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
    .kol-faq__item:hover {
      transform: translateX(2px);
      border-color: rgba(200, 16, 46, 0.4);
    }
    .kol-faq__item[open] {
      border-color: var(--bbg-blue);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 22px -14px rgba(200, 16, 46, 0.4);
    }
    .kol-faq__q {
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: var(--space-5);
      display: flex; align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: var(--space-4);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.3;
      color: var(--bbg-ink);
      list-style: none;
      transition: color var(--dur) var(--ease);
    }
    .kol-faq__q::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    .kol-faq__q::marker { display: none; }
    .kol-faq__item:hover .kol-faq__q { color: var(--bbg-blue); }
    .kol-faq__icon {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 28px; height: 28px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--bbg-surface);
      color: var(--bbg-text-muted);
      transition: transform 320ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
                  color var(--dur) var(--ease),
                  background var(--dur) var(--ease);
    }
    .kol-faq__item[open] .kol-faq__icon {
      transform: rotate(180deg);
      color: var(--bbg-white);
      background: var(--bbg-blue);
    }
    .kol-faq__a {
      padding: 0 var(--space-5) var(--space-5);
      color: var(--bbg-text);
      line-height: 1.65;
      font-size: 1rem;
      animation: kol-faq-in 320ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
    @keyframes kol-faq-in {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-4px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    .kol-faq__a p { margin: 0; }

    .kol-faq-filter {
      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem; justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
      overflow-x: auto;
    }
    .kol-faq-chip {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.5rem 0.95rem;
      background: var(--bbg-white);
      border: 1px solid var(--bbg-border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--bbg-text);
      transition: all 220ms ease;
      font-family: inherit;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .kol-faq-chip:hover { border-color: var(--bbg-blue); color: var(--bbg-blue); }
    .kol-faq-chip.is-active {
      background: var(--bbg-blue);
      border-color: var(--bbg-blue);
      color: var(--bbg-white);
    }
    .kol-faq-chip__count {
      font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.15em 0.5em;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--bbg-surface);
      color: var(--bbg-text-muted);
      transition: all 220ms ease;
    }
    .kol-faq-chip:hover .kol-faq-chip__count { background: var(--bbg-blue-light); color: var(--bbg-blue); }
    .kol-faq-chip.is-active .kol-faq-chip__count {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      color: var(--bbg-white);
    }
    .kol-faq__cat-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--bbg-blue);
      background: var(--bbg-blue-light);
      padding: 0.25em 0.6em;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin-right: var(--space-3);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .kol-faq__q-text { flex-grow: 1; }
    .kol-faq__item.is-hidden { display: none; }

    /* ---------- FINAL CTA ---------- */
    .kol-cta {
      padding: clamp(var(--space-6), 4vw + 1rem, var(--space-8)) var(--space-6);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bbg-blue) 0%, var(--bbg-blue-dark) 100%);
      color: var(--bbg-white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      text-align: center;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .kol-cta::before {
      content: ""; position: absolute;
      top: -40%; right: -10%;
      width: 420px; height: 420px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(255,255,255,0.18) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 65%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .kol-cta .eyebrow--on-dark {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    }
    .kol-cta__title {
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.5vw + 1rem, 2.5rem);
      line-height: 1.15;
      color: var(--bbg-white);
      margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
      letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    }
    .kol-cta__lead {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      max-width: 60ch;
      margin: 0 auto var(--space-5);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .kol-cta__actions {
      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: var(--space-3);
      justify-content: center;
      position: relative;
    }
    .kol-cta__btn-primary {
      background: var(--bbg-white);
      color: var(--bbg-blue-dark);
      border: 1px solid var(--bbg-white);
    }
    .kol-cta__btn-primary:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
      color: var(--bbg-blue-dark);
    }
  </style>

  <script is:inline>
    (() => {
      const reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

      // Reveal-on-scroll
      const revealEls = document.querySelectorAll('.kol-reveal');
      if (revealEls.length) {
        if (reduced || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {
          revealEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('is-in'));
        } else {
          const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
            entries.forEach((entry) => {
              if (entry.isIntersecting) {
                entry.target.classList.add('is-in');
                io.unobserve(entry.target);
              }
            });
          }, { threshold: 0.12, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' });
          revealEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));
        }
      }

      // Hero parallax + scroll progress
      const parallaxEl = document.querySelector('[data-parallax]');
      const progressEl = document.querySelector('.kol-progress__bar');
      const heroEl = document.querySelector('[data-hero]');
      let ticking = false;
      const onScroll = () => {
        if (ticking) return;
        ticking = true;
        requestAnimationFrame(() => {
          const scrollY = window.scrollY || window.pageYOffset;
          if (parallaxEl && heroEl && !reduced) {
            const heroH = heroEl.offsetHeight;
            if (scrollY < heroH) {
              parallaxEl.style.setProperty('--parallax-y', (scrollY * 0.18) + 'px');
            }
          }
          if (progressEl) {
            const docH = document.documentElement.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight;
            const pct = docH > 0 ? Math.min(100, (scrollY / docH) * 100) : 0;
            progressEl.style.setProperty('--progress', pct + '%');
          }
          ticking = false;
        });
      };
      window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });
      onScroll();

      // Smooth scroll for in-page anchors
      document.querySelectorAll('a[href^="#"]').forEach((link) => {
        link.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
          const id = link.getAttribute('href');
          if (!id || id === '#') return;
          const target = document.querySelector(id);
          if (!target) return;
          e.preventDefault();
          target.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduced ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'start' });
          history.replaceState(null, '', id);
        });
      });

      // FAQ accordion - close others on open
      const faqItems = document.querySelectorAll('.kol-faq__item');
      faqItems.forEach((item) => {
        item.addEventListener('toggle', () => {
          if (item.open) {
            faqItems.forEach((other) => {
              if (other !== item && other.open) other.open = false;
            });
          }
        });
      });

      // FAQ category filter
      const faqFilter = document.querySelector('[data-faq-filter]');
      const faqList = document.querySelector('[data-faq-list]');
      if (faqFilter && faqList) {
        const chips = Array.from(faqFilter.querySelectorAll('.kol-faq-chip'));
        const items = Array.from(faqList.querySelectorAll('.kol-faq__item'));
        chips.forEach((chip) => {
          chip.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const cat = chip.dataset.faqCat;
            chips.forEach((c) => {
              const on = c === chip;
              c.classList.toggle('is-active', on);
              c.setAttribute('aria-selected', on ? 'true' : 'false');
            });
            items.forEach((item) => {
              const matches = cat === 'Toutes' || item.dataset.faqCat === cat;
              item.classList.toggle('is-hidden', !matches);
            });
          });
        });
      }
    })();
  </script>
</Layout>
